Version 6.0.1
 PD weapons that only shot down missiles or fighters are no longer hidden from the combat report
 Fixed the ship heading in the combat report for ships without a captain
 The combat report is much lighter on the CPU: its tables are drawn with LazyLib, which is now required
 Ships killed or assisted are drawn with their modules

Version 6.0.0
 Damage is now measured where the game applies it (requires PatchLib), far more accurate than before
 New PatchLib based instrumentation is between 10 and 100x faster
 New "Negated" column in the received summary: damage blocked by armor
 Ships with modules or built-in weapons are drawn whole in the report
 DCR no longer replaces any game files, and mods no longer need DCRIntegration to report damage
 